---
title: API documentation
summary: Where to find rustdoc for every crate, and how to build it locally.
order: 4
---

The API reference is generated by rustdoc from the crate sources.

```sh
cargo doc --workspace --no-deps --open
```

Start at the umbrella crate `skoro`, whose `prelude` lists the types most code needs.

